192610, "dDurationMs": 1320, "segs": [{"utf8": "But it's like now that you're here,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6193930, "dDurationMs": 1440, "segs": [{"utf8": "you don't love me cause you're here.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6195370, "dDurationMs": 4280, "segs": [{"utf8": "And it's like this messed up twisted abandonment issues\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6199650, "dDurationMs": 1440, "segs": [{"utf8": "that I had to rewire in my brain.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6201090, "dDurationMs": 2160, "segs": [{"utf8": "And he was like, what, he's, I'm not leaving.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6203250, "dDurationMs": 1000, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like what are you talking about?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6204250, "dDurationMs": 1520, "segs": [{"utf8": "But I'm like being like a little child\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6205770, "dDurationMs": 1080, "segs": [{"utf8": "and throwing tantrums.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6206850, "dDurationMs": 2420, "segs": [{"utf8": "And it's like, who is this?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6209270, "dDurationMs": 2940, "segs": [{"utf8": "I thought I was meta, I was like Zen and peaceful.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6212210, "dDurationMs": 1720, "segs": [{"utf8": "And then I'm like screaming and crying.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6213930, "dDurationMs": 1840, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like I'm five, six, seven years old.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6215770, "dDurationMs": 2080, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like it's just like uncontrollable.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6217850, "dDurationMs": 3440, "segs": [{"utf8": "And he was like, whoa, it's so heavy.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6221290, "dDurationMs": 3240, "segs": [{"utf8": "But it was like so healing because a normal relationship\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6224570, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "would be like, what the fuck?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6225410, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "This girl is crazy and leaving,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6226250, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "but he could see it as you have trauma to heal.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6229450, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "And that's what we're doing for each other.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6231450, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "And there's a button that I just accidentally pushed.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6232290, "dDurationMs": 1080, "segs": [{"utf8": "Let's investigate.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6233370, "dDurationMs": 1340, "segs": [{"utf8": "What is this?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6234710, "dDurationMs": 1900, "segs": [{"utf8": "It's so cool that you're able to look at it,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6236610, "dDurationMs": 1760, "segs": [{"utf8": "not only together and be like, where can we heal this?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6238370, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "But just the fact that you're able to say now,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6240370, "dDurationMs": 2840, "segs": [{"utf8": "like I don't want to act like that's not me.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6243210, "dDurationMs": 2920, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like cause a lot of times we feel so much shame\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6246130, "dDurationMs": 2760, "segs": [{"utf8": "behind our like outbursts are like,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6248890, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "that we don't really want to deal with the fact\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6250890, "dDurationMs": 2600, "segs": [{"utf8": "that like, man, I was acting out of line.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6253530, "dDurationMs": 2280, "segs": [{"utf8": "And I think maybe this is why.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6255810, "dDurationMs": 1360, "segs": [{"utf8": "A lot of times we want to like, well,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6257170, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "of course I was acting out of line.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6258010, "dDurationMs": 2200, "segs": [{"utf8": "I had a bad day and I had this and blah, blah,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6260210, "dDurationMs": 2680, "segs": [{"utf8": "and you're never on time and all these things.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6262890, "dDurationMs": 1840, "segs": [{"utf8": "And we think that that is like an answer.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6264730, "dDurationMs": 1720, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like that's justification there.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6266450, "dDurationMs": 2840, "segs": [{"utf8": "But it's, there's much more we can look at.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6269290, "dDurationMs": 1880, "segs": [{"utf8": "I mean, you've been in a relationship for how long?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6271170, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "Nine years.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6272010, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6272850, "dDurationMs": 1000, "segs": [{"utf8": "So much communication.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6273850, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "Oh my gosh, yeah.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6274690, "dDurationMs": 1000, "segs": [{"utf8": "And it's always improving.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6275690, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6276530, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "It's always changing.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6277370, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "It's never ending.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6278210, "dDurationMs": 1640, "segs": [{"utf8": "And I think another thing is we don't like to,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6279850, "dDurationMs": 2240, "segs": [{"utf8": "oh, talk about my boyfriend and I fight.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6282090, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "We fight.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6282930, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "It's normal.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6283770, "dDurationMs": 1200, "segs": [{"utf8": "It doesn't mean we're not in love,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6284970, "dDurationMs": 1560, "segs": [{"utf8": "but it's not like fighting where it's like,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6286530, "dDurationMs": 2600, "segs": [{"utf8": "we're being mean to each other and putting each other down.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6289130, "dDurationMs": 3640, "segs": [{"utf8": "It's not that kind of like dirty fighting.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6292770, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6293610, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "When people are like, they're like, here,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6294450, "dDurationMs": 2160, "segs": [{"utf8": "I know something that you personally feel\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6296610, "dDurationMs": 1160, "segs": [{"utf8": "very uncomfortable about yourself.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6297770, "dDurationMs": 1360, "segs": [{"utf8": "I'm gonna throw it at you.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6299130, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like, I know you.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6299970, "dDurationMs": 1280, "segs": [{"utf8": "I've seen those kind of fights.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6301250, "dDurationMs": 1560, "segs": [{"utf8": "You know, I have friends that fight like that.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6302810, "dDurationMs": 1840, "segs": [{"utf8": "I'm like, yeah, that's not right.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6304650, "dDurationMs": 1760, "segs": [{"utf8": "That's not, that's, you know, that is there.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6306410, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "It's toxic.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6307250, "dDurationMs": 1000, "segs": [{"utf8": "It's very toxic.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6308250, "dDurationMs": 1720, "segs": [{"utf8": "And I think just noticing like, okay,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6309970, "dDurationMs": 2240, "segs": [{"utf8": "so if you're one of these people and that's happened to you\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6312210, "dDurationMs": 2560, "segs": [{"utf8": "and your anger gets the best of you and whatever,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6314770, "dDurationMs": 2080, "segs": [{"utf8": "like if now, right, this conversation is like,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6316850, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "oh crap, maybe I do this.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6317690, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "Triggering something?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6318530, "dDurationMs": 1120, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah, and it does trigger something.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6319650, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "That's something that's being pushed up on again.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6322450, "dDurationMs": 2400, "segs": [{"utf8": "And you can, now when this happens again,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6324850, "dDurationMs": 1880, "segs": [{"utf8": "you're gonna have this little sliver, I bet.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6326730, "dDurationMs": 1160, "segs": [{"utf8": "That's gonna be like, hmm,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6327890, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "maybe I don't have to react like that.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6328730, "dDurationMs": 1840, "segs": [{"utf8": "I'm queen of talking about relationships.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6330570, "dDurationMs": 2160, "segs": [{"utf8": "I think I love being in a relationship.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6332730, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "It helps me grow.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6333570, "dDurationMs": 920, "segs": [{"utf8": "It's a mirror.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6334490, "dDurationMs": 2960, "segs": [{"utf8": "I can learn more about, I love being in a relationship.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6337450, "dDurationMs": 2480, "segs": [{"utf8": "It shows me where I need to grow.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6339930, "dDurationMs": 1520, "segs": [{"utf8": "When you're by yourself, you're like, yeah, yeah, yeah,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6341450, "dDurationMs": 2560, "segs": [{"utf8": "but when you're living in a small quarter with someone,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6344010, "dDurationMs": 1800, "segs": [{"utf8": "you're like, ooh.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6345810, "dDurationMs": 1640, "segs": [{"utf8": "Because really like the person you're with\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6347450, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "should make you better.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6349450, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "Or what's the point?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6350290, "dDurationMs": 2840, "segs": [{"utf8": "To me, the whole point of our relationship is to love\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6353130, "dDurationMs": 2320, "segs": [{"utf8": "and help each other grow and grow individually,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6355450, "dDurationMs": 1320, "segs": [{"utf8": "but together at the same time,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6356770, "dDurationMs": 1720, "segs": [{"utf8": "kind of like a money tree, like this.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6358490, "dDurationMs": 2280, "segs": [{"utf8": "You know, and have the same visions\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6360770, "dDurationMs": 1160, "segs": [{"utf8": "and encourage each other.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6361930, "dDurationMs": 2640, "segs": [{"utf8": "And like, if your partner isn't doing that for you,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6364570, "dDurationMs": 1520, "segs": [{"utf8": "like, I know this sounds like shitty,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6366090, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "but it's like, what's the point?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6368110, "dDurationMs": 2280, "segs": [{"utf8": "To me, in my relationship,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6370390, "dDurationMs": 1760, "segs": [{"utf8": "if they're not making you grow or pushing you\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6372150, "dDurationMs": 1160, "segs": [{"utf8": "or supporting you and all they're doing\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6373310, "dDurationMs": 1920, "segs": [{"utf8": "is thinking your ideas are dumb\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6375230, "dDurationMs": 2280, "segs": [{"utf8": "and they're putting you down all the time,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6377510, "dDurationMs": 1960, "segs": [{"utf8": "is that really like what you want?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6379470, "dDurationMs": 3080, "segs": [{"utf8": "Cause I know so many women that are in shitty relationships\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6382550, "dDurationMs": 1920, "segs": [{"utf8": "with people who put them down.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6384470, "dDurationMs": 1800, "segs": [{"utf8": "I hear some of the things that these men say\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6386270, "dDurationMs": 2680, "segs": [{"utf8": "to my friends and I'm like, oh.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6388950, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6389790, "dDurationMs": 2280, "segs": [{"utf8": "Someone you love the most is putting you down the most.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6392070, "dDurationMs": 1760, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like, oh God.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6393830, "dDurationMs": 1800, "segs": [{"utf8": "Do you think that a lot of people like so-\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6395630, "dDurationMs": 1960, "segs": [{"utf8": "When you take the love you think you deserve, right?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6397590, "dDurationMs": 1200, "segs": [{"utf8": "Oh yeah, that's a rough one too.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6398790, "dDurationMs": 2590, "segs": [{"utf8": "That's definitely, I mean-\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6401380, "dDurationMs": 1320, "segs": [{"utf8": "But these men, I just don't even know\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6402700, "dDurationMs": 1760, "segs": [{"utf8": "if they know they're doing it or I don't know.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6404460, "dDurationMs": 3520, "segs": [{"utf8": "I think a lot of it is, you know, not that it's okay.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6407980, "dDurationMs": 1200, "segs": [{"utf8": "That doesn't matter if they make it okay,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6409180, "dDurationMs": 2720, "segs": [{"utf8": "but I think a lot of our, when we make fun of people\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6411900, "dDurationMs": 2320, "segs": [{"utf8": "and the things that we say in the, you know-\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6414220, "dDurationMs": 1800, "segs": [{"utf8": "Well, men being feminine too\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6416020, "dDurationMs": 3720, "segs": [{"utf8": "and expressing their feelings is like taboo.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6419740, "dDurationMs": 2360, "segs": [{"utf8": "I mean, yeah, my whole life has definitely been,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6422100, "dDurationMs": 3800, "segs": [{"utf8": "I've been beat up by Rednecks growing up.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6426860, "dDurationMs": 3840, "segs": [{"utf8": "I've always been, so like in Kelso for as far as,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6430700, "dDurationMs": 1280, "segs": [{"utf8": "as far as what I was aware,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6431980, "dDurationMs": 1640, "segs": [{"utf8": "I was probably too focused on myself, right?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6433620, "dDurationMs": 1280, "segs": [{"utf8": "But like in high school, I was like,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6434900, "dDurationMs": 2640, "segs": [{"utf8": "oh, I'm the first guy to wear the tight pants.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6437540, "dDurationMs": 1920, "segs": [{"utf8": "I'm the first guy to try a red eyeliner\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6439460, "dDurationMs": 1040, "segs": [{"utf8": "and see who says anything about me.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6440500, "dDurationMs": 1560, "segs": [{"utf8": "I'm the first guy to dye my hair pink.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6442060, "dDurationMs": 3040, "segs": [{"utf8": "He sort of, like, I probably wasn't really, but-\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6445100, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "Even your mind.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6445940, "dDurationMs": 1600, "segs": [{"utf8": "Right, but-\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6447540, "dDurationMs": 1160, "segs": [{"utf8": "But to feminine.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6448700, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah, but you see how other people react.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6450700, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "Or trigger.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6451540, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "And they hate it and a lot of guys like,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6455180, "dDurationMs": 1640, "segs": [{"utf8": "I say Rednecks, beat up by Rednecks.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6456820, "dDurationMs": 1520, "segs": [{"utf8": "That's just a term that around here,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6458340, "dDurationMs": 3680, "segs": [{"utf8": "a lot of people, you know, drive a Toyota,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6462020, "dDurationMs": 1120, "segs": [{"utf8": "work in a lumber mill, you know,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6463140, "dDurationMs": 2720, "segs": [{"utf8": "these sort of personality types.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6465860, "dDurationMs": 2320, "segs": [{"utf8": "But a lot of times I would notice,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6468180, "dDurationMs": 5080, "segs": [{"utf8": "it's not so much that they're trying to make fun of me\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6473260, "dDurationMs": 2160, "segs": [{"utf8": "as much as it's like an unawareness\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6475420, "dDurationMs": 1400, "segs": [{"utf8": "that they are making fun of me.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6476820, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "They don't realize what the