 [{"utf8": "It's just them being them.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6543970, "dDurationMs": 2080, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah, I think we're like the more you,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6546050, "dDurationMs": 2480, "segs": [{"utf8": "the more you like meditate and the more you,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6548530, "dDurationMs": 2480, "segs": [{"utf8": "for me, it was definitely staying away from social media.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6551010, "dDurationMs": 1720, "segs": [{"utf8": "You start to like realize that like the things\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6552730, "dDurationMs": 1400, "segs": [{"utf8": "that you held on to, like your judgments\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6554130, "dDurationMs": 2360, "segs": [{"utf8": "about other people, they float away to where like,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6556490, "dDurationMs": 2400, "segs": [{"utf8": "you don't even remember that you had them at some point.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6558890, "dDurationMs": 1480, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like you're just talking to someone\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6560370, "dDurationMs": 2440, "segs": [{"utf8": "and then I don't know, you wouldn't even notice\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6562810, "dDurationMs": 1360, "segs": [{"utf8": "something like if they're wearing a ton of makeup,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6564170, "dDurationMs": 2240, "segs": [{"utf8": "you wouldn't notice that if you did before.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6566410, "dDurationMs": 4840, "segs": [{"utf8": "No, and I just think like this area is super,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6571250, "dDurationMs": 1800, "segs": [{"utf8": "I don't know, but like it's,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6573050, "dDurationMs": 2160, "segs": [{"utf8": "I don't feel like a lot of people are truly\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6575210, "dDurationMs": 2840, "segs": [{"utf8": "stepping into their authenticity and being themselves\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6578050, "dDurationMs": 2720, "segs": [{"utf8": "because we mask it with a lot of things.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 6580770, "dDurationMs": 2120, "segs": [{"utf8": "Cause I feel like a lot of us do the same things every da