onMs": 1480, "segs": [{"utf8": "and be like, hey, how are you doing on that?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7308610, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "We should-\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7309450, "dDurationMs": 1280, "segs": [{"utf8": "Well, it's crazy because it's like a collective shift.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7310730, "dDurationMs": 1680, "segs": [{"utf8": "I'll get these crazy ideas and thoughts\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7312410, "dDurationMs": 1200, "segs": [{"utf8": "that just download into my brain\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7313610, "dDurationMs": 2240, "segs": [{"utf8": "and I'll talk to my partner and he's like, same.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7315850, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "So it's crazy.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7316690, "dDurationMs": 4020, "segs": [{"utf8": "I'm vegetarian and yesterday I ate meat.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7320710, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "It's just so weird.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7321550, "dDurationMs": 1440, "segs": [{"utf8": "But I was ashamed.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7322990, "dDurationMs": 1560, "segs": [{"utf8": "I was like, cause I haven't eaten meat.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7324550, "dDurationMs": 1340, "segs": [{"utf8": "How long has it been?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7325890, "dDurationMs": 3660, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like I've been vegetarian for like three years.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7329550, "dDurationMs": 2320, "segs": [{"utf8": "I've like, but yesterday I just like, I don't know why\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7331870, "dDurationMs": 2920, "segs": [{"utf8": "but like this piece of sausage, like it looks so good.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7334790, "dDurationMs": 960, "segs": [{"utf8": "I'm like, what the hell?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7335750, "dDurationMs": 1000, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like I love animals.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7336750, "dDurationMs": 1880, "segs": [{"utf8": "So I'm like, and then I talked to my boyfriend.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7338630, "dDurationMs": 1360, "segs": [{"utf8": "I'm like, I have a confession.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7339990, "dDurationMs": 1040, "segs": [{"utf8": "And I was like, he's like, what?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7341030, "dDurationMs": 920, "segs": [{"utf8": "I'm like, I had a piece of sausage.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7341950, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "He's like, that's so weird.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7342790, "dDurationMs": 1320, "segs": [{"utf8": "I had a chicken sandwich yesterday.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7344110, "dDurationMs": 920, "segs": [{"utf8": "He's vegetarian too.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7345030, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "And I'm like-\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7346690, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "I'm like, it's-\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7347530, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "I wonder about that.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7348370, "dDurationMs": 1000, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like, what is that?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7349370, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "You know, like-\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7350210, "dDurationMs": 1160, "segs": [{"utf8": "I don't know.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7351370, "dDurationMs": 1720, "segs": [{"utf8": "He's like, I didn't feel good.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7353090, "dDurationMs": 1520, "segs": [{"utf8": "I only had blah, blah, blah.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7354610, "dDurationMs": 1560, "segs": [{"utf8": "I'm like, he's like the only thing there was\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7356170, "dDurationMs": 2080, "segs": [{"utf8": "and like whatever and like, there was more food.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7358250, "dDurationMs": 1200, "segs": [{"utf8": "But it's so weird.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7359450, "dDurationMs": 3240, "segs": [{"utf8": "And it's just, I think when we label ourselves\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7362690, "dDurationMs": 960, "segs": [{"utf8": "we get, feel ashamed.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7363650, "dDurationMs": 1480, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like, I'm a vegetarian and I eat an animal.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7365130, "dDurationMs": 880, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like I'm a bad person.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7366010, "dDurationMs": 1440, "segs": [{"utf8": "It's like, no, we make mistakes.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 