, "segs": [{"utf8": "I just wanna, I feel like you have knowledge\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7402710, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "in the outdoors.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7403550, "dDurationMs": 4940, "segs": [{"utf8": "And I'm so, I'm very intrigued by obviously anything diet-wise\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7408490, "dDurationMs": 2600, "segs": [{"utf8": "or like how things go into the body as far as nature.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7411090, "dDurationMs": 4600, "segs": [{"utf8": "But I'm just very much, I haven't fully ex-\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7415690, "dDurationMs": 1200, "segs": [{"utf8": "You want me to tell you why I'm vegetarian?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7416890, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "Cause I would love to.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7417730, "dDurationMs": 1360, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah, let's do that, yes.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7419090, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "So it all started when I was at summer camp.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7421890, "dDurationMs": 2040, "segs": [{"utf8": "I'm like, I'm just gonna tell everyone I'm vegetarian\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7423930, "dDurationMs": 2560, "segs": [{"utf8": "even though I wasn't, but I'm prideful, right?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7426490, "dDurationMs": 1880, "segs": [{"utf8": "So it was crazy cause 20 of the camp\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7428370, "dDurationMs": 1000, "segs": [{"utf8": "counts were vegetarian.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7429370, "dDurationMs": 1240, "segs": [{"utf8": "So it was just like a vibe.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7430610, "dDurationMs": 1920, "segs": [{"utf8": "And I was like, I'm just gonna say I'm vegetarian.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7432590, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "And once I say that, I'm prideful, I'm not gonna eat meat.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7434590, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "So that's how I was able to fully stick to it.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7437790, "dDurationMs": 1320, "segs": [{"utf8": "If I was living on my own,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7439110, "dDurationMs": 3120, "segs": [{"utf8": "I don't know how it would have transformed into me\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7442230, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "not eating meat.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7443070, "dDurationMs": 2280, "segs": [{"utf8": "But since I was placed in a camp situation\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7445350, "dDurationMs": 2560, "segs": [{"utf8": "where I wasn't able to choose my food,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7447910, "dDurationMs": 1920, "segs": [{"utf8": "but everyone else was looking at what I was eating\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7449830, "dDurationMs": 1360, "segs": [{"utf8": "cause I said I was vegetarian.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7451190, "dDurationMs": 2280, "segs": [{"utf8": "So that's how I was able to fully embody\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7453470, "dDurationMs": 2920, "segs": [{"utf8": "like not eating meat and move to Hawaii and eat fish.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7456390, "dDurationMs": 1680, "segs": [{"utf8": "So I haven't been full, okay, it's pescatarian,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7458070, "dDurationMs": 2180, "segs": [{"utf8": "but I don't really eat fish anymore.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7460250, "dDurationMs": 3540, "segs": [{"utf8": "But the reason I really, really chose to stop\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7463790, "dDurationMs": 5000, "segs": [{"utf8": "is because I look at a pig or a chicken or a cow\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7470090, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "with the same love that I do when I look at my partner\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7472890, "dDurationMs": 3280, "segs": [{"utf8": "because it's, they're, they're alive.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7476170, "dDurationMs": 1960, "segs": [{"utf8": "And they have, to me, I feel their energy\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7478130, "dDurationMs": 2880, "segs": [{"utf8": "and their soul and their heart beating.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7481010, "dDurationMs": 2880, "segs": [{"utf8": "And like, I don't know, like,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7483890, "dDurationMs": 3000, "segs": [{"utf8": "I don't feel like I'm any better than animals or bugs.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7486910, "dDurationMs": 1040, "segs": [{"utf8": "I've never killed a bug.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7487950, "dDurationMs": 1000, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like, this is just me.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7488950, "dDurationMs": 1400, "segs": [{"utf8": "I'm very empathetic.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7490350, "dDurationMs": 3480, "segs": [{"utf8": "And I just, I have dreams of like factory farms.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7493830, "dDurationMs": 2760, "segs": [{"utf8": "And like, I just, you know, growing up around cows,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7496590, "dDurationMs": 2480, "segs": [{"utf8": "like I, you know, I just couldn't imagine like killing\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7499070, "dDurationMs": 3240, "segs": [{"utf8": "and like, I see them on the, on the trucks and I cry.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7502310, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "And I'm like, personally, I couldn't kill an animal.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7505110, "dDurationMs": 3380, "segs": [{"utf8": "So I feel like I don't deserve to eat it for me.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7508490, "dDurationMs": 3000, "segs": [{"utf8": "What was happening is I would be eating a hamburger\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7511490, "dDurationMs": 1120, "segs": [{"utf8": "and I was sad.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7512610, "dDurationMs": 1400, "segs": [{"utf8": "I would start to cry.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7514010, "dDurationMs": 2360, "segs": [{"utf8": "And I asked one of my spiritual teachers what's going on\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7516430, "dDurationMs": 1880, "segs": [{"utf8": "and she's like, well, you're taking on the fear\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7518310, "dDurationMs": 840, "segs": [{"utf8": "of that animal.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7519150, "dDurationMs": 1600, "segs": [{"utf8": "So think about how scared these animals are\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7520750, "dDurationMs": 1400, "segs": [{"utf8": "when they're dying, right?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7522150, "dDurationMs": 1840, "segs": [{"utf8": "And then think about the people killing the animals.\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7523990, "dDurationMs": 2080, "segs": [{"utf8": "They don't like what they're doing for t